SIGNALS (these tags appear in brackets after release names):
pub:DATE, seed:N, votes:N, grabs:N, PROPER, REPACK, REMUX, DV, HDR10+, HDR10, HDR, 3D, HARDCODED-SUBS

HOW TO READ THE BRACKETED TAGS NEXT TO EACH CANDIDATE:
- pub:DATE = when the release was published. Compare to air date. Published BEFORE air date = suspicious (fake or pre-air leak).
- seed:N = torrent seeders. 0 seeders = dead or fake. High seeders = popular/trusted.
- votes:N = community votes. Negative votes = flagged as bad.
- grabs:N = usenet downloads. High grabs = popular.
- PROPER = replacement for a flawed earlier release. Usually better.
- REPACK = re-packaged release fixing issues. Usually better.
- REMUX = full quality disc rip, very large.
- DV / HDR10+ / HDR10 / HDR = HDR colour metadata kobload's parser confirmed in the filename (DV wins when multiple are present).
- 3D = stereoscopic 3D release.
- HARDCODED-SUBS = subtitles burned into the picture; treat as REJECT when the QUALITY WANT block has `REJECT HARDCODED SUBS`.
